.. jab kuch nahi bachta?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, jab kuch nahi bachta, use batane ke liye zero chahiye. Cricket mein batsman bina run banaye out hua. Uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... score zero hoga"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, bina run ke score zero hai. Ab 6 aur 9 ko dekho. Dono mein kya fark hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... 6 mein golai neeche hai aur 9 mein golai upar hai... aise"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne bola, 6 ki golai neeche aur 9 ki upar hai. Bholu ne ghar ka number 6 ulta likha. Woh kehta hai ab bhi chhah hai. Kya woh sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi, ulta likhne se 6 nahi rahega... wo 9 ban jaayega"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, 6 ulta batao toh 9 ban jaata hai. Ab number naam dekhein. Seven kaun sa number hai, aur Hindi mein kya bolte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"7... saat"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, seven matlab 7, Hindi mein saat. Ab socho, ghar ka number 7 hai. Uske liye kitni taaliyaan bajaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"saat taaliyaan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, saat taaliyaan! Saat bolna aur 7 dekhna, dono ek hi ginti batate hain. Ab nau kaun sa number hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nau maane 9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau matlab 9. Ab ulta ginte hain: 3, 2, 1. Uske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 1 ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab taar par teen chidiya baithi hain. Teeno udd jaati hain. Taar par kitni chidiya bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kyunki teeno udd gayi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiya bachi, kyunki teeno udd gayi. Ab 6 aur 9 ka fark dekhenge. Dono ko seedha rakhne par alag number milte hain."}],"usage":{"usd":0.0771,"tokens":52131},"boards":4,"lastMs":4460,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["3 2 1 ?"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 3 2 1 ?"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct